      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "By way of literature review, clarifications are made in the terminology employed in discussing the atypical post-traumatic pain syndromes, particularly reflex sympathetic dystrophy (RSD). Causalgia is a form of RSD and is the focus of a case report presented from the files at St. Anne's Hospital-West, Northlake, Illinois."},
